{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:30.574347+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1R8XE9PDKFYD019X50ASW", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M7X1R8XDJ07G2FFDP8HBKYCQ", "input_key": "primary_scenario", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Who hits the stale refusal, when, and what must happen next?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:30.574347Z", "run_id": "01M7X1R8XDJ07G2FFDP8HBKYCQ", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:30.573746Z", "step_id": "specify.scenario.primary"}}
{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:33.415292+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1RBP7ZRHXFR7C2V9BZEQA", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M7X1R8XDJ07G2FFDP8HBKYCQ", "final_answer": "Answered from #7755/#7754 (unattended scheduled run): the operator running spec-kitty consolidate on a lanes Mission whose approved lanes edit the same file; the in-run auto-rebase of the later lane stops on a conflict with a sibling lane consolidated earlier in that run; the rollback then restores the Mission branch. The refusal must say the auto-rebase stopped and why, name the sibling lane branch (it survives rollback), and give a remedy that works for an approved WP; after the operator follows it, the next run must pass the lane.", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:33.415292Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M7X1R8XDJ07G2FFDP8HBKYCQ", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:33.414353Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:36.187998+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1RECWER7FTP5DYEA13XSJ", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M7X1RECT6FH6ZM1ZB97FMZVC", "input_key": "remedy_route", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "Which recovery route does the refusal prescribe for an approved work package?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:36.187998Z", "run_id": "01M7X1RECT6FH6ZM1ZB97FMZVC", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:36.186862Z", "step_id": "specify.remedy.route"}}
{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:38.908318+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1RH1WPQFZNZDJ4Q565WZY", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M7X1RECT6FH6ZM1ZB97FMZVC", "final_answer": "Reopen the WP (move-task --to planned --review-feedback-file, costs a re-review), re-enter it with agent action implement (names the lane checkout), merge the named sibling lane branch there and resolve, commit, hand back for review and approval, re-run consolidate. Verified end to end in an exploratory run: the next consolidate passes the lane and reconciliation verifies. A refusal with no sibling lane keeps the implement auto-rebase refresh, preceded by the reopen step (#7754).", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:38.908318Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M7X1RECT6FH6ZM1ZB97FMZVC", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:38.907186Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:41.720759+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1RKSRXB3SBJF7Y3ZZS6C1", "event_type": "DecisionPointOpened", "payload": {"actor_id": "cli", "actor_type": "human", "decision_point_id": "01M7X1RKSQB4HCPCTD2MJXVFPW", "input_key": "rollback_scope", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "options": [], "origin_flow": "specify", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "phase": "SPECIFY", "question": "May the fix change rollback behaviour (keep the sibling on the Mission branch)?", "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:41.720759Z", "run_id": "01M7X1RKSQB4HCPCTD2MJXVFPW", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:41.719459Z", "step_id": "specify.scope.rollback"}}
{"at": "2026-11-20T17:58:44.540784+00:00", "event_id": "01M7X1RPHWBQCZA648VG8ASX1J", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M7X1RKSQB4HCPCTD2MJXVFPW", "final_answer": "No. Rollback semantics, the single rollback authority, CAS discipline and the approved-bound refusals stay unchanged; the fix is diagnostic and remedy text only. Dry-run forecasting of this refusal (#7324) and the reconciliation attribution of unreviewed merges (#5604/#5053) stay out of scope.", "mission_id": "01M7X1QSXKVTHS52Z1CQHMVZ03", "mission_slug": "stale-lane-sibling-recovery-01M7X1QS", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:44.540784Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M7X1RKSQB4HCPCTD2MJXVFPW", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-20T17:58:44.539545Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
